			}]
			title: "Borrowed Time"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["Right-click it when you want the next wave - it won't come on its own until the timer runs out, so take the gap if you need to patch up or restock. I'd rather choose my moment than get caught mid-repair."]
