			title: "A Stone That Remembers"
			x: 13.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: [
				"Wire it right and it does two things at once - cuts and slows anything that tries to push through. Needs power to make, not just a workbench; the rig for that's already set up in here somewhere. Never seen barbed wire do more than that, but I only ever wired up the one line."
			]
