		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: ["A Bear Trap won't kill on its own, but it holds whatever steps in it in place - long enough for you or something else to finish the job. Resets itself once it's sprung, near as I can tell, so it's not a one-time thing. Never tested how many times before it actually gives out."]
