		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: [
				"Whoever built the press and mill in here never got around to powering them - there's an open slot where a crank should sit. Take some planks and an Andesite Alloy to it and it'll finish the job; the andesite itself never seems to turn up close to home, only out in the old structures past the wall. Never checked whether it's just this stretch of desert, or the whole wasteland's picked clean of it near any real ground."
			]
