		{
			dependencies: ["7D3A5F912E6C0B48"]
			description: ["The stand's been waiting a long time for something to hold. Set the pendant down and the wall stops being a wall - for you, anyway. Everything out there stops watching you and starts watching it instead. No more mending, no more warmth, but nothing's stopping you from walking past that line. Just remember what you're leaving unguarded."]
