		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1454951A7FB14A26"]
			description: ["Wire an Igniter to redstone and it lights the ground on a signal - undead catch fast, and fire keeps working after you've moved on to the next thing. Worth knowing it'll ignite anything flammable nearby too, not just what you're aiming at. Never traced exactly how far it spreads."]
