		{
			dependencies: ["1454951A7FB14A26"]
			description: ["A Fan pushes anything caught in front of it, on a signal - mobs, items, doesn't discriminate. Point it right and it does the aiming for you, funneling things into whatever's actually going to finish them off. Still working out the best angle myself."]
