			dependencies: ["1454951A7FB14A26"]
			description: ["A Magnetic Chest pulls in anything dropped nearby once it's wired up - saves you walking back after a fight to collect what's left. Range seems to depend on the chest itself, not the signal. Never measured it exactly."]
