		{
			dependencies: ["1454951A7FB14A26"]
			description: ["An Auto-Turret keeps firing on its own once it's placed and stocked with arrows - it'll pick targets in range without you doing anything. First thing in this place that can actually watch a wall while you're somewhere else. Haven't tested what happens if it runs dry mid-wave."]
