		{
			dependencies: ["689899208FC0ADF0"]
			description: ["Five waves was as far as whoever held this post before you got. You've matched that, and the gear's finally given out - it was never going to last past this point anyway. Everything from here is genuinely unwritten; nobody's diary goes further than this."]
