		{
			dependencies: ["F58E263493C23094"]
			description: ["Eight was the last wave anyone bothered planning for - after this, it just keeps escalating, no ceiling anyone's found yet. Whatever gear and defenses you've built by now are what you're taking into it. I don't know how far it actually goes. Maybe you'll be the one who finds out."]
